      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FEDERAL PLAYER (2) jumped favourite and was too quick with an all-the-way win last start (29.86) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 515m. Boasts five wins from six starts out of this box. Hard to go past. HUNTERVIEW LAD (1) bolted in last time, scoring by 2.25 lengths in slick time (22.95) to take a Free For All in a new PB this course and distance. Top win latest and can measure up again. ZIPPING HAGEN (7) isn't a quick beginner but comes home hard, finishing out of the frame two back but did wind up strongly to place when third (23.15) in a Free For All at this track. Form here sound including four wins. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from six starts. Can feature again. LAURIE'S FERRARI (4) is worth consideration.",
